       "text": "A heatwave affected the town of Verlow from 22 June to 1 July 2026, placing the electricity network under strain.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Marnest substation was destroyed and service at Verlow General Hospital was disrupted, with dangerous conditions reported at Hetton Rise and Camber Green.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "Injuries were confirmed in the town and deaths were attributed to the heatwave and to the warning period.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "The Provincial Public Health Institute and Grennet Power deployed and issued warnings, and the network operator revised its policy.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
